      <h5 class="upper">Goals and Accomplishments</h5>
      <p class="main">
        Define GHG reduction science-based targets (SBTi) for net-zero target of 2045. (Pending)
        <br> Use 100% renewable electricity. *2005-2021
        <br> eWaste Recycling - monitors, batteries, etc... *Since 2004
        <br> Reduce Travel with Telecommuting and Virtual/Web Conferencing *Since 2004
        <br> Compliance reports are available <a href="mailto:admin@roos.com">by request</a>.
      </p>
      <div class="hidden">
