        <p class="main">
          <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://www.earthhour.org" target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow"><img src="/images/EH_tiny.jpg" alt="Earth Hour - Logo"
              style="max-width:205px; max-height: 205px; float: right; clear: right; margin: 4px 0 4px 8px;" /></a>
          Since 2010, RI has participated in
          <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://www.earthhour.org" target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Earth Hour</a> by switching OFF our lights
          for an hour on March 26th at 8:30pm. If you are our customer, vendor, or partner, please join our partner
          program (below) and <a href="mailto:admin@roos.com">let us know</a> what else you will be doing for the rest
          of the year to be green.
        </p>
